    "description": {
      "_type": "localizedPortableText",
      "de": [
        {
          "_key": "f9c0e519ee2a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "45158e67de63",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Soboro-Brot ist ein klassisches koreanisches Bäckereibrot mit einer süßen, krümeligen Oberfläche. Besonders typisch ist das knusprige Soboro-Topping aus Butter, Erdnussbutter, Zucker und Mehl. Ich bereite das Topping während der ersten Gärung des Brotteigs zu, sodass sich beide Arbeitsschritte gut miteinander verbinden lassen. Das Topping ist unkompliziert: Die Zutaten werden einfach miteinander vermischt und anschließend auf den weichen Brotteig gedrückt."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6fee7813c84f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "fa6a4d1d84a7",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ""
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "en": [
        {
          "_key": "7615cb49a496",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "64124d849130",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Soboro bread is a classic Korean bakery bread with a sweet, crumbly topping. Its characteristic texture comes from a simple soboro topping made with butter, peanut butter, sugar, and flour. I prepare the topping while the bread dough is going through its first rise, so the two parts of the recipe fit together easily. The topping itself is simple to make: the ingredients are mixed together and then pressed onto the soft bread dough."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
