    "description": {
      "_type": "localizedPortableText",
      "de": [
        {
          "_key": "9356b39d4e59",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "f6e4d7fffb6c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Dies ist eines der klassischsten Brote, das in Korea verkauft wird. Zu den Brotsorten, die Koreaner am häufigsten wählen, gehören das Soboro-Brot und dieses süße Azuki-Bohnenbrötchen, das Danpatbbang(단팥빵)."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "73191ff5760f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "0786365e68d6",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Ich kaufe die Füllung für Danpatbbang meistens in einem ostasiatischen Markt hier in Deutschland. Sie wird oft in Dosenform verkauft und kommt aus Japan. Auf meiner Zutaten-Seite finden Sie dazu Fotos und Beschreibungen."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "en": [
        {
          "_key": "f3d6e8bc97be",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "3b71a7f41a52",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Danpatbbang is a classic Korean bread filled with sweet red bean paste. Along with soboro bread, it is one of the most familiar bakery treats in Korea."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "94b8fed741ef",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "11076816b6a4",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Ready-made sweet red bean paste is often sold in cans or packages at Korean, Japanese, or other East Asian grocery stores. Using prepared filling makes this recipe much easier, but you can also make the red bean paste from scratch."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "b265c600f494",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "2974813d4d74",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The soft bread and smooth, sweet filling make danpatbbang especially good with coffee, tea, or a glass of milk."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
