              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Sobald sich der Teig im Teigkneter zu einer Kugel formt, die Butter hinzufügen und weiterkneten."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "92b6f6f64e34",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "18479aeef1ef",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Den Teig für die erste Gärung etwa 50 Minuten ruhen lassen."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d088c2cbd16b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "a3a4b0cd40dc",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Währenddessen die Azuki-Bohnenpaste (Anko) in 40-g-Kugeln formen und bereitstellen."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "15c360515dc0",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "ecf91c13693e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Nach der ersten Gärung den Teig durchkneten, um die Luft herauszulassen, und in 8 Stücke teilen. Den Teig mit Folie abdecken und etwa 10 Minuten für die Zwischenruhe ruhen lassen."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d5e86564f8c6",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "bcc0f9c1f7c2",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Nach der Zwischenruhe den Teig flach ausrollen, die Bohnenpaste darauf legen und den Teig zu einer runden Form schließen."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "300306d2e40d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "d2b1b2135976",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Den Teig flach drücken und in der Mitte kräftig mit einem Nudelholz drücken. Mit einer Schere sechs Schnitte in den Teig machen."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "1d21498e6cb6",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "22a5701476e3",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Den Teig mit Abstand auf ein Backblech legen und für die zweite Gärung etwa 45 Minuten ruhen lassen."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "b4521c68b4d6",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "df70d39d2fc0",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Nach der Gärung das aufbewahrte Ei mit etwas Wasser vermischen und den Teig damit bestreichen. Für die Dekoration Walnüsse, schwarze Sesamsamen oder andere Nüsse verwenden."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a697d8b7f9a7",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "ce08b6dfae22",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Im vorgeheizten Ofen bei 190 Grad etwa 10 Minuten backen."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f73460dc14d8",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "21d9e7e4daed",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Die süßen Bohnenbrötchen (Danpatbbang) sind fertig! Es entstehen etwa 7-8 Brötchen."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "309ca9f9ef0c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "97ccdc36d216",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ""
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "en": [
        {
          "_key": "f2b14a226c8d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "0b36fc66cd2c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In a bowl, add lukewarm milk and an egg. Beat the egg, reserving a little for later, and then add it to the bowl. Measure and add wheat flour, sugar, salt, and yeast."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f61f523ee683",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "2cc28f137f33",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Once the dough forms a ball in the mixer, add butter and continue kneading."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a423949760c7",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "bafb7b46cb4a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Let the dough rest for the first rise, about 50 minutes."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "91db4b3635e8",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "a4a98398ea32",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Meanwhile, shape the azuki bean paste (anko) into 40 g balls and set aside."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0c8a5e792dd6",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "184677b17173",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "After the first rise, knead the dough to release the air and divide it into 8 pieces. Cover with plastic wrap and let it rest for about 10 minutes."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2ba37a55e2cd",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "81b7ff8e9649",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "After resting, roll each piece of dough flat, place a ball of bean paste in the center, and seal it into a round shape."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "57ac64a19f01",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "fe6d3e559d8c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Flatten the dough slightly, then press firmly in the center with a rolling pin. Make six cuts in the dough with scissors."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "1ad6a700531c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "220acbbe8a3e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Place the dough pieces with space between them on a baking sheet and let them rise for the second time, about 45 minutes."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5f61271d9bec",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "cb9f6114d30b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "After the second rise, mix the reserved egg with a little water and brush it over the dough. For decoration, you can use walnuts, black sesame seeds, or other nuts."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7799a1aa0a8d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "b7c3fbbed587",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Bake in a preheated oven at 190°C for about 10 minutes."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2c3537a01469",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "aaf62e8b6226",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The sweet bean buns (Danpatbbang) are ready! This recipe yields about 7-8 buns."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "1b90df41210a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "63a60b9ce606",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ""
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
